    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking the price",
     "texto": [
      "**Was kostet dieses Kleid?** (singular) and **Was kosten diese Schuhe?** (plural).",
      "**Zu** in front of an adjective means «too»: **zu teuer** (too expensive), **zu klein**.",
      "**Teuer** = expensive. **Billig** = cheap."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "In the shop",
     "texto": [
      "**Kann ich es anprobieren?** = can I try it on? Note: with «kann», the other verb goes **at the end**, unsplit.",
      "**Die Größe** is the size.",
      "When you decide to buy something, the pronoun depends on the gender: **Ich nehme ihn** (der), **Ich nehme sie** (die), **Ich nehme es** (das).",
      "To pay: **mit Karte** (by card) or **bar** (in cash)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
